  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Offer exactly four unique wordlist words. The correct tap is the word that comes first when you compare up to the first three letters.",
      "Never use a set that ties on the first three letters. Those three letters must pick one clear winner.",
      "Tier 1: all four words share the first letter. The second letters are far apart.",
      "Tier 2: all four words share the first two letters. The third letters decide the order.",
      "Tier 3: all four words share the first two letters. The third letters are close, and one distractor is the word that comes second.",
      "Keep every word in the kid world: school, home, food, pets, play, family, or weather. No brands. No real names.",
      "Do not write the ABC answer in the stem. The stem only names the four words."
    ]
  },
